id: pm-rust-tdps
title: Track oracle read refusal for dependency rows without timestamps
description: "During configured hierarchy differentials, the pinned 2026.10.14 oracle refused an item with several dependencies containing only id and kind: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading localeCompare). Supplying created_at on each dependency makes the real item readable. The orchestrator filed https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1482 and reproduced the defect on pm 2026.10.15. Keep valid timestamped fixture rows for this slice; reassess after an oracle update."
type: Task
status: open
priority: 3
