parent: pm-rust-u4al
comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-16T02:46:53.200Z",codex-agent,"Upstream tracking correction: the orchestrator filed https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1482. Its pm 2026.10.15 reproduction shows that two or more dependency rows without created_at crash pm get with Cannot read properties of undefined (reading localeCompare); one row is readable, and pm validate is silent. This records the supplied upstream reproduction and supersedes the stale no-issue statement without rewriting history."
  "2026-10-16T03:24:17.437Z",codex-agent,"Round 2 metadata correction is complete: the description and docs link now reference pm-cli issue 1482, and the supplied 2026.10.15 reproduction facts are recorded above. All pre-existing history bytes remain intact. Restoring this upstream follow-up to open and releasing ownership; no item is closed and the oracle pin is unchanged."
